WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:10.840
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:16.890
closed captions

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:19.600
You're late, Rumi-san!

00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:21.670
Sorry about that!

00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:24.110
We sure got a full house here, don't we?

00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:26.790
Well, of course! It's the finals of the Grand Prix!

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:30.370
Will Ichigo-chan be okay?

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:32.780
I'm getting all nervous myself!

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:34.110
The screen changed!

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:37.930
What the heck?

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.460
OP sequence

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:05.870
Sweet, like love: Château confectionery's Premium Milk Chocolate!

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:08.710
What? It's just some commercial?

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:12.050
This coverage of the World Cake Grand Prix finals

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:15.050
is brought to you by Château confectionery International!

00:01:16.580 --> 00:01:19.430
And when exactly did you film that?

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:23.560
I-I didn't think the commercial would turn out like this.

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:25.950
Oh sure, whatever you say.

00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:27.630
You looked pretty into it to me.

00:01:27.630 --> 00:01:29.350
Y-You don't understand!

00:01:29.350 --> 00:01:32.260
You see, I showed up as a favour to her

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:36.990
since she helped you go all the way to Japan to find those fraises de bois.

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:39.160
And before I knew it,

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:41.430
they just started filming in the studio.

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:44.310
Ready? Action!

00:01:50.530 --> 00:01:51.400
Cut!

00:01:53.930 --> 00:01:56.010
Isn't this great, Makoto-kun?

00:01:56.050 --> 00:01:57.890
Okay, next is...

00:01:57.890 --> 00:02:00.490
I had no idea what they were filming...

00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:03.860
They must have composited it with CG,

00:02:03.860 --> 00:02:06.050
and turned it into a commercial like that...

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:09.570
The World Cake Grand Prix Fi-

00:02:10.810 --> 00:02:13.610
The picture's gone out again...

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:20.620
She cleaned up our school really nice, but I wish she'd have bought us a new television too...

00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:22.900
Don't go saying that!

00:02:22.900 --> 00:02:25.250
Yeah! It'll come back to haunt you!

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:28.950
I'll be your reporter, Koshiro Miya!

00:02:28.950 --> 00:02:32.960
Watch all the way to the end! If... you... please!

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:35.710
Si, señorita!

00:02:38.860 --> 00:02:45.130
fuwa fuwa funwari amakute toro kechau

00:02:38.860 --> 00:02:45.130
Fluffy, fluffy, fluffiness, so sweetly it melts.

00:02:45.130 --> 00:02:50.540
shiawase wo ageru yo yumeiro no pâtishièeru<i>!!</i>

00:02:45.130 --> 00:02:50.540
I'll give you happiness, the dream-coloured Pâtissière<i>!!</i>

00:02:50.540 --> 00:02:56.000
ichigo furejie & furanbowaazu, hapihapi makaron, hapinesu made go!

00:02:50.540 --> 00:02:56.000
Strawberry Fraisier & Framboise, happy happy Macaron, Happiness made go!

00:02:56.000 --> 00:03:01.170
chansu no tobira aketa toki kara kibun joujou ↑ ↑

00:02:56.000 --> 00:03:01.170
Since I opened the door of chance, my mood lifted.

00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:05.130
youkoso suiitsu no oukoku he

00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:05.130
Welcome to the Kingdom of Sweets.

00:03:05.130 --> 00:03:06.050
Bon appétit!

00:03:06.050 --> 00:03:13.440
hajimehane, hetappi demo megezu ni hibishoujin<i>!</i>

00:03:06.050 --> 00:03:13.440
Though I was terrible at the beginning, I was diligent everyday<i>!</i>

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:16.060
「makeruna<i>! atashi」</i>

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:16.060
「I won't lose<i>!</i> I said to myself」

00:03:16.230 --> 00:03:17.070
Courage!

00:03:18.270 --> 00:03:23.850
My dream migakeba hikaru takaramono

00:03:18.270 --> 00:03:23.850
My dream when polished is a shining treasure.

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:26.570
fairy chikara kashite<i>!</i>

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:26.570
Fairy, lend me your strength<i>!</i>

00:03:26.570 --> 00:03:32.000
shifon, se shibon, juré, bonjuuru, hatsuratsu furuutsu, raburii made go!

00:03:26.570 --> 00:03:32.000
Chiffon, C'est si bon, Gelée, Bonjour, Lively fruits, Lovely made go!

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:38.080
nakitaku natte mo egao ni nareru mahou

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:38.080
Even if you cry, there is magic that can make you smile.

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:43.300
「oishii<i>!」 wo tsukurutte omoikkiri tanoshii ne</i>

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:43.300
「Delicious<i>!</i>」 and making it wholeheartedly is fun.

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:49.300
fuwa fuwa funwari amakute toro kechau

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:49.300
Fluffy, fluffy, fluffiness, so sweetly it melts.

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:54.690
shiawase wo ageru yo yumeiro no pâtishièeru<i>!!</i>

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:54.690
I'll give happiness to you, the dream-coloured Pâtissière<i>!!</i>

00:03:54.690 --> 00:03:59.230
ichigo furejie & furanbowaazu, hapihapi makaron, fun fun

00:03:54.690 --> 00:03:59.230
Strawberry Fraisier & Framboise, happy happy Macaron, fun, fun

00:03:59.230 --> 00:04:01.400
yume ni eeru<i>!</i>

00:03:59.230 --> 00:04:01.400
Get them in our dreams<i>!</i>

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:05.910
Presented by Wasurenai-subs

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:05.910
