00:04:06.710 --> 00:04:13.760
Bonjour. Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:21.970
recipe 49

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:21.970
The Finals at the Palace of Versailles<i>!</i>

00:05:26.640 --> 00:05:30.860
Currently, both teams are waiting quietly for the subject and theme to be announced.

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:37.430
What is with this phony sounding play-by-play?

00:05:37.430 --> 00:05:39.490
Did you come up with this, Satou?

00:05:39.490 --> 00:05:40.560
Ojou-sama!

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:41.840
You're on!

00:05:44.060 --> 00:05:45.550
I apologise!

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:48.410
The judges are entering the hall!

00:05:55.270 --> 00:05:57.660
I will now announce the subject and theme.

00:05:58.170 --> 00:05:59.450
There are two subjects.

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:03.600
The first is an entremet made with chocolate.

00:06:03.700 --> 00:06:09.430
The second is a plated dessert that uses both hot and cold sweets.

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:13.180
As it's the finals, we're going with the old themes, I see.

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:16.520
The theme is "A Happy Family Get-Together."

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:22.470
Please make an entremet and a plated dessert that a family can enjoy together.

00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:25.680
You have three hours to finish them.

00:06:25.680 --> 00:06:27.450
Three hours?

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:31.160
We should split up and have each person work on their specialty instead of forcing things.

00:06:32.020 --> 00:06:34.230
The chocolate entremet should be Kashino and...

00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:36.070
I'll design it.

00:06:36.070 --> 00:06:39.530
So you want to create an entremet with a Japanese taste?

00:06:39.530 --> 00:06:40.240
Yeah...

00:06:40.550 --> 00:06:43.890
Then Hanabusa-kun and I'll handle the plated dessert.

00:06:43.890 --> 00:06:44.450
Right.

00:06:44.450 --> 00:06:46.660
Now, begin the match!

00:06:49.810 --> 00:06:51.460
It's started...

00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:53.670
I'm sure Ichigo-chan'll be fine...

00:06:53.920 --> 00:06:56.610
Go for it, Ichigo-chan!

00:06:59.450 --> 00:07:01.860
They've started cooking right off the bat.

00:07:01.860 --> 00:07:04.190
I guess they predicted the subject ahead of time.

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:06.490
Well, we can't get beat by that.

00:07:06.490 --> 00:07:10.440
I also guessed it would be an entremet and prepared a design...

00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:14.090
I like the fact it's square instead of round.

00:07:14.090 --> 00:07:15.740
And it uses a chocolate ganache, right?

00:07:15.780 --> 00:07:16.670
Right.

00:07:16.670 --> 00:07:18.610
Okay, let's make it, and win!

00:07:21.660 --> 00:07:24.840
Not a movement wasted... So elegant, so beautiful...

00:07:25.190 --> 00:07:27.210
She's almost like Henri-sensei!

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:28.150
Ichigo-chan.

00:07:28.570 --> 00:07:30.300
This is no time to be impressed.

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:33.850
We haven't decided what to make yet, right?

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:35.610
Sorry about that...

00:07:35.610 --> 00:07:36.720
Umm...

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:43.550
I'm kind of getting an image of the two of our families having a fun tea-party together in a rose garden.

00:07:43.550 --> 00:07:47.130
So your family, and my family?

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:53.940
And your father is with us too, of course, Hanabusa-kun.

00:07:57.730 --> 00:08:00.210
I'm getting a wonderful vision of that...

00:08:03.910 --> 00:08:06.130
Good. How about something like this?

00:08:07.660 --> 00:08:09.790
Yeah! Let's get started right away!

00:08:13.310 --> 00:08:15.000
The tarts are baked.

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:18.270
Brush them with egg, but don't get any in the cream.

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:29.560
So they're using that Sweets Crafts that's the trend in Paris lately...

00:08:29.560 --> 00:08:30.820
Can't lose to that, can I?

00:08:32.970 --> 00:08:37.820
I cannot even fathom what sweets both teams are creating!

00:08:39.800 --> 00:08:42.030
That's... black pepper?

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:51.090
Darling! What are you making?

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:54.450
Who're you calling "Darling?" Don't get in my way, please!

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:57.130
Oh, Makoto-kun... You're so shy!

00:09:09.140 --> 00:09:11.910
We've already passed the 15 minute mark!

00:09:11.910 --> 00:09:13.890
How are both team's final preparations coming?

00:09:18.090 --> 00:09:20.860
Ichigo, we're all ready over here.

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:21.990
We don't have any time left!

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:23.310
Just a little longer...

00:09:23.310 --> 00:09:26.530
I'm going to wait until exactly the time I calculated for the ice cream to melt.

00:09:26.530 --> 00:09:29.600
What are you doing? You've barely got five minutes left.

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:30.740
And it's that five minutes we're betting on.

00:09:32.410 --> 00:09:34.210
Hanabusa-kun, let's do it!

00:09:57.720 --> 00:09:58.710
All right.

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:05.640
The green colour of the maccha really livens up the chocolate!

00:10:05.640 --> 00:10:07.780
It'll be such a shame to eat it!

00:10:08.820 --> 00:10:10.910
So it's finally time for the tasting and scoring...

00:10:13.160 --> 00:10:16.630
It looks like Team François's entremet is a tarte chocolat.

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:21.030
First, they'll be judged on their overall look and design.

00:10:22.090 --> 00:10:23.890
Next, the taste will be inspected.

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:34.650
That kick to it is black pepper, yes?

00:10:34.930 --> 00:10:37.610
Spiciness and sweetness together, like adult and child.

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:41.030
It really is a perfect flavour for a family get-together.

00:10:44.760 --> 00:10:49.370
Was that... Does the Chairman of the Paris campus not like pepper?

00:10:50.340 --> 00:10:52.700
We'll continue with Team Ichigo's entremet.

00:10:52.700 --> 00:10:54.550
Oh, look at this...

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:57.710
The colour and finish make me think of bamboo. Well done.

00:10:57.960 --> 00:10:59.680
Next, the tasting...

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:08.880
The white maccha that's been layered into the biscuit joconde combines just splendidly with the ganache.

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:13.020
Hey, Ichigo... Check out the Italian Chairwoman...

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:13.890
Yeah...

00:11:13.890 --> 00:11:15.800
I wonder if she's tired?

00:11:17.810 --> 00:11:19.210
Thank goodness!

00:11:19.210 --> 00:11:23.510
The maccha and sweetness of the chocolate glaçage must have perked her up!

00:11:24.190 --> 00:11:28.440
Finally, it's time to announce the scores! First up, Team François!

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:43.910
491?

00:11:43.910 --> 00:11:45.920
What a crazy score, right off the bat!

00:11:57.970 --> 00:12:01.730
Now, continuing... What is Team Ichigo's score for their entremet?

00:12:09.900 --> 00:12:11.010
Damn it!

00:12:11.010 --> 00:12:14.820
I'm sorry... I might have added Japanese flavour too much, and...

00:12:15.190 --> 00:12:18.670
If we had done something that allowed your specialty flavour, chocolate, to come through...

00:12:18.740 --> 00:12:25.290
No... Just considering Team François's tempering, they were a step better than me.

00:12:25.750 --> 00:12:29.420
I think it was your maccha cream that narrowed the gap to only 1 point.

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:31.800
Shake it off, Kashino!

00:12:31.800 --> 00:12:35.260
We're only down by one! We still have a chance to make a comeback!

00:12:35.260 --> 00:12:36.160
That's right!

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:38.030
Father, what's your problem?

00:12:38.030 --> 00:12:40.690
If you'd given them a perfect score, they could have tied!

00:12:42.750 --> 00:12:45.280
The judging of the plated desserts has begun!

00:12:45.560 --> 00:12:47.360
That's wonderfully done.

00:12:47.360 --> 00:12:49.830
I bet that inside the Sweets Craft is...

00:12:52.480 --> 00:12:55.420
Break the Sweets Crafts and eat it together, please.

00:12:58.970 --> 00:13:01.790
There's a hot sauce from inside the Sweets Craft...

00:13:05.460 --> 00:13:06.130
This is...

00:13:06.460 --> 00:13:11.320
As the warm sauce and the lemon sherbet mix in my mouth

00:13:11.320 --> 00:13:14.710
I taste a flavour I can't even describe...

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:17.860
The texture of the candy art is also superb.

00:13:20.300 --> 00:13:21.360
Très bien!

00:13:21.810 --> 00:13:24.030
Although his face looked puckered for a second...

00:13:24.030 --> 00:13:26.360
The sauce must have quickly counteracted the sour taste.

00:13:27.270 --> 00:13:29.180
Next up is Team Ichigo!

00:13:29.180 --> 00:13:32.410
What plated dessert awaits us underneath the cloche?

00:13:38.980 --> 00:13:40.250
A lovely rose scent...

00:13:41.540 --> 00:13:45.650
Hanabusa-kun, your father's rosewater really brings out the flavour...

00:13:45.650 --> 00:13:48.970
Or rather, brings out the aroma...

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:54.510
There is a strawberry sauce coming out from the inside!

00:13:54.510 --> 00:13:59.690
The hidden scent of roses and the strawberry smell combine to delight the palate!

00:14:00.010 --> 00:14:03.400
As the piping hot soufflé melts the vanilla ice cream.

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:10.190
The sour accent from the strawberry sauce, it's really like a family laughing together in a rose garden!

00:14:10.930 --> 00:14:13.530
Now, it's time for the scores to be announced!

00:14:13.530 --> 00:14:14.940
First up, Team François!

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:25.760
Team François scores top marks, yet again!

00:14:26.110 --> 00:14:28.070
485 points, huh?

00:14:29.210 --> 00:14:32.060
We lost by one point for the entremet.

00:14:32.060 --> 00:14:35.530
So we have to score more than 486 or we'll lose!

00:14:35.530 --> 00:14:38.310
God, Buddha, Queen of Sweets, please!

00:14:38.340 --> 00:14:40.760
And now, Team Ichigo's score!

00:14:48.600 --> 00:14:50.300
All right!

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:51.940
But...

00:14:54.730 --> 00:14:56.410
Who could have thought that...

00:14:57.260 --> 00:14:58.460
It can't be helped...

00:14:58.760 --> 00:14:59.790
I'm sorry.

00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:01.700
A tie...

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:04.590
So then, both teams win?

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:09.340
The judges are currently conferring.

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:12.090
How will this competition be concluded, I wonder?

00:15:16.540 --> 00:15:18.100
It looks like the conference is over!

00:15:22.130 --> 00:15:24.440
As the result of the judges' conference,

00:15:24.800 --> 00:15:27.230
there will be a rematch to determine the winner!

00:15:27.270 --> 00:15:28.920
A rematch?

00:15:28.920 --> 00:15:30.950
What will the subject be this time?

00:15:31.270 --> 00:15:34.320
The rematch will not be a team battle,

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:36.160
it will be an individual competition!

00:15:37.050 --> 00:15:38.210
An individual competition?

00:15:38.210 --> 00:15:42.460
Like the one I totally screwed up with Lemon-chan back in Japan?

00:15:43.810 --> 00:15:46.360
You've grown a lot since then!

00:15:46.360 --> 00:15:48.420
You'll be fine now, Amano-san.

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:50.110
Fight, Ichigo-chan!

00:15:50.110 --> 00:15:51.480
You guys...

00:15:52.060 --> 00:15:53.250
Yeah.

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:56.220
The subjects for the individual matches

00:15:56.220 --> 00:16:00.140
will be the basic building blocks of sweets, the batters.

00:16:00.490 --> 00:16:02.040
You will use four types of batter:

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:06.860
Pie batter, choux batter, croissant batter, and succès batter.

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:09.870
You'll now have a break for lunch.

00:16:09.870 --> 00:16:17.280
Will the team leaders please submit which member will make which batter before the match begins.

00:16:19.740 --> 00:16:22.350
This garden is incredible!

00:16:22.350 --> 00:16:25.350
It's even prettier than the palace gardens in the Kingdom of Sweets!

00:16:25.350 --> 00:16:27.920
And why exactly are you relaxing, staring off at the scenery?

00:16:29.200 --> 00:16:32.090
Amano, we're deciding who'll handle which batter.

00:16:32.160 --> 00:16:34.000
Oh, right.

00:16:35.660 --> 00:16:36.780
Umm, out of the four,

00:16:36.780 --> 00:16:41.280
I only have confidence in the the choux batter from when I made the croqembouche

00:16:41.280 --> 00:16:44.560
or the pie batter from when I made the apple pie!

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:48.410
Croissants were taught in our first year,

00:16:48.410 --> 00:16:50.190
so I guess you haven't learned that yet, Amano-san.

00:16:50.510 --> 00:16:54.940
And the succès batter that is used for macarons is taught in the third year.

00:16:54.940 --> 00:16:57.700
I've practiced it a lot, so I think I'll be okay.

00:16:58.020 --> 00:17:03.780
It can't be helped. Andou, you handle the croissant, and Hanabusa should handle the succès, okay?

00:17:03.780 --> 00:17:04.210
Right.

00:17:04.280 --> 00:17:06.710
Then I'll be in charge of the simplest one, the choux batter!

00:17:07.090 --> 00:17:08.660
Don't underestimate choux!

00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:10.050
It's not just used for choux crème!

00:17:10.060 --> 00:17:12.740
The Éclair and Paris-Brest are based on it, too!

00:17:12.740 --> 00:17:13.950
Paris-Brest?

00:17:13.950 --> 00:17:18.030
Oh! You mean that wheel shaped Éclair I ate when I was in Paris?

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:19.970
That praline cream was quite delicious.

00:17:20.140 --> 00:17:22.020
And can you make praline cream?

00:17:23.830 --> 00:17:25.560
Fine, I've got no choice.

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:27.610
I'll handle the choux batter.

00:17:27.610 --> 00:17:29.730
So that means I'm in charge of the pie batter.

00:17:30.140 --> 00:17:32.160
I suppose one loss doesn't matter.

00:17:32.160 --> 00:17:34.400
As long as we three win, we'll win it all.

00:17:34.840 --> 00:17:36.230
What's that supposed to mean?

00:17:36.230 --> 00:17:37.990
It's like you're expecting me to lose!

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:39.970
And do you really have the confidence to win?

00:17:39.970 --> 00:17:41.360
Eh... That's...

00:17:41.360 --> 00:17:42.620
Chocolat, that's rude!

00:17:42.940 --> 00:17:46.460
Hasn't Ichigo always gotten through the tough spots with her hard work?

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:48.410
Oh, was that what it was?

00:17:48.410 --> 00:17:50.060
Chocolat!

00:17:54.240 --> 00:17:59.750
The rematch has finally begun, and Andou-kun is up against Katie making croissants.

00:17:59.750 --> 00:18:02.630
